1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
The night was holding its breath.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
A child's shadow shouldn't be riding the last train.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,800
The novice exorcist's hands trembled.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Two minutes left. If the paper works in time.

5
00:00:15,069 --> 00:00:18,069
Give me your name, before the paper bites down.

6
00:00:18,069 --> 00:00:21,069
It hurts. I don't want it to.

7
00:00:21,069 --> 00:00:24,069
You smell like Mommy.

8
00:00:24,069 --> 00:00:27,069
Mm... don't forget your umbrella...

9
00:00:27,069 --> 00:00:30,069
If it were hatred, it would bite straighter than this.

10
00:00:30,162 --> 00:00:33,362
The bottom of the water called into the carriage.

11
00:00:33,162 --> 00:00:37,162
Beyond the glass, I could only see her hands.

12
00:00:37,162 --> 00:00:41,162
If I seal her away, she'll stay drowned forever.

13
00:00:41,162 --> 00:00:45,162
Don't get off yet.

14
00:00:45,231 --> 00:00:47,765
The last stop was still far away.

15
00:00:47,231 --> 00:00:51,231
Um... did you forget something?

16
00:00:51,231 --> 00:00:55,731
No. I missed my stop.

17
00:00:55,731 --> 00:01:00,231
Just one station. I'll get her off.
